# grown_island · an island 8 km across grown the way nature grows land:
# drifting plates lift its mountain ranges, rivers carve its valleys as it
# rises, lakes fill its hollows, wind from the west rains on the mountains'
# near side and leaves their far side dry; sand on the shores, grass, forests
# where it is wet and warm, bare rock high and steep. Its land and trees are
# made a chunk at a time round the player as they walk. The player starts on
# gentle land looking towards the mountains.
#
# kind: world
# place: grown_island(3)
# (any whole number: each grows a different island)
# credit: J Production, made in Loop3D
# licence: our own work, free for every J Production project
# from: the picture pipeline's phase 10 (2026-11-10)

to grown_island(seed)
  world(seed: seed)
  sky "physical", haze: 2
  sun elevation: 35 deg, toward: 210 deg
